                "text": "Whether it\u2019s for work, school, or staying in touch with family, rural broadband access isn\u2019t a luxury\u2014it\u2019s a necessity. It was great to meet with telecom leaders from across Upstate today to talk about how we can expand coverage and lower costs. https://t.co/gnUanDvxKK",
