                "text": "The Senate voted to cut Medicaid.\n\nTo slash food assistance.\n\nTo put rural hospitals one step closer to shutting their doors.\n\nI don't know a single person in Upstate New York who thinks we should balance the budget by taking meals from kids and healthcare from working families.",
