                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The GOP\u2019s Big Ugly Bill guts Medicaid, puts hundreds of rural hospitals at risk, and drives doctors & nurses out of Upstate NY. I voted no, called it out on the House floor, and I\u2019m not done\u2014I\u2019ll keep fighting to protect our care.\n\nhttps://t.co/tYiMg2Vhg9",
